! Deferred + pinned — do not lose

# ''① `tend.repair` + the LAMPLIGHTER / KAHU cabal split'' — ''LAMPLIGHTER'' = independent operators who RUN + TEND INFRASTRUCTURE (herms, islands, relays); ''KAHU'' = stewards of the Nexus/DreamNet SOFTWARE + GRAMMAR (the memetic-wikitext grammar, the protocol — the TW5-Syntax arc is Kahu ground); some operators hold BOTH. ''Prerequisite (operator):'' a human watches a browser↔node session where file projections TEAR, before the caretaker's reach gets designed. ''Plan:'' (1) two has-cap STACKS composed not fused — Lamplighter (run/tend/repair/recover infra) + Kahu (grammar/software/protocol stewardship); (2) the FROST k-of-n threshold Place-DID cure for `tend.repair`→`@daemon` — a Lamplighter cap must not reach a herm's raw signing key alone; a quorum signs a repair, the herm's own `@daemon` testimony stays independent; (3) red-first: `tend.repair` cannot sign `@daemon` solo. RULING owed: the FROST split + the cap boundary. Deferred, PINNED.
# ''The self-slot INNER ring'' — NARROWS-only (can only tighten a self-verdict), bounded one-message-wide + an IRREVERSIBLE naming freeze (a bag URL through a live ring hashes to seed its Document; a re-name costs a re-founding). ''Plan:'' (1) widen the bridge first — a `bagUrlForDoc` resolver at the shore (reversible); (2) then, ONLY on an explicit operator ruling of the naming freeze, wire it. No admission-widening urgency pulls it forward. RULING owed: the naming freeze, deliberately.
# ''The ahi-kā deferred knobs'' — ''hard gate:'' a Negative-Binomial estimator fit against Elyncia's 500-year event corpus (calibrate the rate params, replacing the fiction-QA defaults). ''Then:'' (a) the hysteresis gap — revival cost scales with cold-depth (no thrash); (b) the commons-vs-hearth exemption — a private single-steward hearth never colds, a multi-steward commons cools normally. Red-first each. No ruling owed; gated purely on the estimator.

